# The blanket *.pdf above is for the course docs — the CV PDFs are served by the
# site (the #cv "Resume" button links to them), so they must be committed.
!assets/cv/*.pdf

# Raw camera exports (NN.jpg) live here only until they're converted to NN-opt
# jpg/webp — the site only ever loads the -opt versions, so keep the originals
# local instead of committing multi-MB files.
assets/images/photos/[0-9][0-9].jpg
